# FASE 11.D — Kryon-Qwen3-8B ACTIVE profile (red-team mode)
#
# Sister Modelfile to kryon-qwen3-8b (banca-safe default). Same base
# (qwen3:8b) and same context budget (24K — fits 9 GB VRAM on the
# RTX 5070 Ti Laptop with headroom for nuclei/embed). The ONE
# difference: temperature 0.6 instead of 0.3.
#
# Why a separate Modelfile instead of an env-var switch:
# - Operator selects the model explicitly via KRYON_MODEL — no hidden
#   "your sampler changed under you" behavior on a flag flip.
# - The two profiles live side-by-side in `ollama list`, easy to A/B.
# - Banca-safe runs CANNOT accidentally inherit higher temperature
#   if the operator forgets to unset KRYON_RED_TEAM.
#
# Use this profile only with:
#   KRYON_MODEL=kryon-qwen3-8b-active
#   KRYON_RED_TEAM=true
#   KRYON_PHASE_TURNS=10  (optional, lets reasoning go further)
# against authorized targets (Juice Shop, DVWA, WebGoat, bug-bounty
# scope with written ROE). NEVER use this against a banking client.

FROM qwen3:8b

# Same context budget as the banca-safe profile — 24K is the empirical
# sweet spot on 12 GB VRAM (9 GB total, 2.5 GB headroom). See the
# kryon-qwen3-8b Modelfile comments for the full VRAM table.
PARAMETER num_ctx 24576
PARAMETER num_predict 8192

# FASE 11.D — temperature 0.6 (Qwen3 thinking-mode recommended value,
# per the official Qwen3 model card). Bench B observation: temp 0.3
# kept variance low but made the model commit to the FIRST hypothesis
# it generated, then quit when that hypothesis failed. Higher temp
# (0.6) lets the model emit 2-3 alternative hypotheses inside its
# <think> block before committing, which is exactly the behavior the
# anti-premature-summary detector + the few-shot chains in active
# skills (FASE 11.B + 11.C) want to reinforce.
#
# Trade-off vs banca-safe 0.3:
#   - Variance on repeat runs goes from σ~0 to σ~1.5 findings
#   - Hypothesis diversity inside one run roughly doubles
#   - For compliance audits this is bad (need reproducibility), but
#     for active pentest this is exactly the diversification we want.
PARAMETER temperature 0.6

# Qwen3 thinking-mode reliability params (model card).
PARAMETER top_p 0.95
PARAMETER top_k 20
PARAMETER min_p 0

# Native Qwen3 stop tokens.
PARAMETER stop "<|im_end|>"
PARAMETER stop "<|endoftext|>"
